**1. Goal Setting & Mindset:**

* **Start Small & Specific:** Don't aim to be fluent in 6 months. Instead, set tiny, achievable goals. Examples: "Learn 10 new words this week," "Be able to order a coffee in the language," "Watch a 5-minute YouTube video with subtitles."
